_:na81235464c934b31a7a3a81f05908382b10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#inversePath> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentLogicalView> .
_:nd12221bb6e154b4fa21672edf0aa43acb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:parentLogicalView property must be specified for a rml:LogicalViewJoin, with a resource as its value.\r\n        " .
_:n884d9b38106640d98b3760f92e085593b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A template (format string) to specify how to generate a value for a \n        subject, predicate, or object, using one or more columns from a logical\n        table row or iterator.\n        " .
