_:n82d341a4efa9444cbf819676cb728452b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n82d341a4efa9444cbf819676cb728452b4 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Term Map.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLCurrentWorkingDirectoryShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://w3id.org/rml/TriplesMap> .
_:n92f96ec9c6874c69beb5fff9c44730aab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n                PREFIX rml: <http://w3id.org/rml/>\n                SELECT $this\n                WHERE {\n                    $this rml:constant ?value .\n                    FILTER (lang(?value) != \"\")\n                }\n            " .
_:n5a09a07057f5407dbf73b30f26b42601b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:ne81ed17802b441c08aa8e4a8a2429d3db10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:ne81ed17802b441c08aa8e4a8a2429d3db16 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the object for the generated RDF triples.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapORPredicateObjectMapShape> .
_:na695952ca626484da94585138e0c0a72b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:childMap must point to a rml:ChildMap specifying the\n        child of the Literal.\n        " .
_:na6ca5537adba4744ab686612bbc8d88db3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:na6ca5537adba4744ab686612bbc8d88db4 .
_:nbd4fcd9cfa484957841295e2be1e0631b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n5a09a07057f5407dbf73b30f26b42601b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:compression specifies the compression algorithm to use when\n        accessing the data source. By default, no compression is applied.\n        " .
_:n884d9b38106640d98b3760f92e085593b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:n51e91d24e6124154b38b5b81ae5fa0e1b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:na695952ca626484da94585138e0c0a72b12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the child of the object component for joining.\n        " .
_:nbd4fcd9cfa484957841295e2be1e0631b34 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateObjectMap> .
_:n0919bfd4fc854bc8802ad6307b174c53b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/datatype> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLDatatypeMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:DatatypeMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference, or rml:constant\n    with the IRI of the datatype.\n    " .
_:nbd4fcd9cfa484957841295e2be1e0631b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either a rml:subject, rml:subjectMap is required, not multiple.\n        " .
_:nbd4fcd9cfa484957841295e2be1e0631b13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> .
_:nbd4fcd9cfa484957841295e2be1e0631b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Subject Map element to generate a subject for generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:N9d2e684f2f7c4c93bd1172c3b5e42932 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N7a54f42d3a224f52a6a70acb1e819918 .
