_:nd12221bb6e154b4fa21672edf0aa43acb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        At least one rml:parentLogicalView property must be specified for a rml:LogicalViewJoin, with a resource as its value.\r\n        " .
