<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Iterable must specify how to generate logical iterations on a data source.\r\n    " .
_:n936f60076079491294b8489d27784242b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:target must be provided to locate the target. rml:target must \n        be provided exactly once as an URI.\n        " .
