<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    rml:AbstractLogicalSource must specify how to generate logical iterations on a data source for a triples map.\r\n    " .
