_:na81235464c934b31a7a3a81f05908382b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    RML Target accepts one rml:compression, and one rml:encoding.\n    All of them are optional.\n    " .
