_:n936f60076079491294b8489d27784242b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:logicalTarget must reference a valid RML Logical Target.\n        " .
_:nbd4fcd9cfa484957841295e2be1e0631b14 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:baseIRI must be an IRI.\n        " .
