_:nd12221bb6e154b4fa21672edf0aa43acb3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        A field of the logical view join.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LogicalViewJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    A LogicalViewJoin is an operation that adapts the logical iterations of one logical view (the child logical view) with fields from another logical view (the parent logical view).\r\n    " .
_:n82d9f8b9d2734995b9d3a28aee2520f8b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:root" .
_:n690dad85e58f432dbb4026414530006eb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The logical iterator (rml:iterator) defines the iteration loop used to \r\n        map the data of the input source. Depends on the reference formulation\r\n        if an iterator is necessary.  \r\n        " .
