_:na695952ca626484da94585138e0c0a72b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the child of the object component for joining.\n        " .
_:nd12221bb6e154b4fa21672edf0aa43acb3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LeafExpressionFieldShape> .
