_:n51e91d24e6124154b38b5b81ae5fa0e1b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/joinCondition> .
_:na81235464c934b31a7a3a81f05908382b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n       The value of a rml:structuralAnnotation property must be a resource.\n        " .
_:nc8be0bc4488c4a0da532ab659a15801ab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/fieldName> .
_:na81235464c934b31a7a3a81f05908382b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:field property must be specified for a rml:LogicalView, with either an rml:ExpressionField or an rml:IterableField its value.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StructuralAnnotation" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A source describes access to a data source. Any data access description\n    is allowed, but rml:Source provides additional properties to complete\n    such descriptions.\n    " .
